1
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:12,980
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:16,000
[Episode 13]

3
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:53,170
I'm not leaving.

4
00:01:53,630 --> 00:01:54,570
You're mine.

5
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,210
If one of us goes, we both go.

6
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,110
Okay?

7
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,240
You won't agree, huh?

8
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:23,920
Then I'll have no choice
but to expose you to the media.

9
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,430
Let them see

10
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:28,579
what you looked like as a child,

11
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:31,329
and what Lan was like back then.

12
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:21,630
Mr. Cui, you're here.

13
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:23,120
Welcome, welcome!

14
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,030
It's an honor to finally meet you.

15
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:25,250
Please, have a seat.

16
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,140
You're too kind, Mr. Zhao.

17
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:34,560
I heard you had something special
planned for tonight?

18
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,560
Of course.

19
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:38,910
I have two friends
who are eager to meet you.

20
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:48,890
-Hello, Mr. Cui.
-Hello, Mr. Cui.

21
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:53,750
That's it?

22
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:55,680
I heard...

23
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:06,960
Mr. Cui,
you certainly have a discerning eye.

24
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,490
But don't worry.

25
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:11,500
I've still got an ace up my sleeve.

26
00:04:26,050 --> 00:04:30,030
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

27
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:40,330
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

28
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,980
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

29
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,680
So, Mr. Cui,

30
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:55,950
see anyone you like?

31
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:59,000
I'll have her brought right up.

32
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,190
Hello,

33
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,560
are you Director Zhang?

34
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,200
Wasn't I told to come in for an audition?

35
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:47,750
The person I just spoke to

36
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:50,409
said a director thought
I had a lot of potential.

37
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:55,840
That's right. It's an audition.

38
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,240
Xiao.

39
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:44,830
Hello, Lan.

40
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,659
I'm at your place.

41
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,430
Lan?

42
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:57,950
Xiao.

43
00:06:58,520 --> 00:07:00,320
You finally came to see me.

44
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:02,310
Lan, what's wrong with your voice?

45
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:05,270
My vocal cords were slightly damaged
after the surgery.

46
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:07,220
Does my voice sound bad?

47
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,510
No, no, not at all.

48
00:07:22,270 --> 00:07:23,480
-Xiao.
-Lan, you...

49
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:24,920
Xiao, please don't leave me, okay?

50
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,310
I've given you everything.

51
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:27,710
I can't live without you.

52
00:07:27,710 --> 00:07:28,830
You're all I have.

53
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:30,530
I'm not going to leave you.

54
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,870
Trust me.

55
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,480
I just need
to take care of a few things first.

56
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,300
Once I've taken care of everything,

57
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:37,900
I'll tell the whole world

58
00:07:38,130 --> 00:07:40,510
that you're the woman
I love more than anyone. Okay?

59
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:41,800
-Really?
-Of course.

60
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:43,190
Why would I lie to you?

61
00:07:43,310 --> 00:07:44,430
I'll come back to you as soon as

62
00:07:44,430 --> 00:07:45,680
I've taken care of everything.

63
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,800
Be good, okay?

64
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,159
-Remember to call me.
-I will, I will.

65
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,540
Don't forget to keep in touch with me.

66
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,900
[Script]
[Int. Lu Family Villa–Living Room–7:00 PM]

67
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,840
Want some?

68
00:08:35,789 --> 00:08:36,700
I'm good.

69
00:08:36,730 --> 00:08:38,620
What are you writing?

70
00:08:39,610 --> 00:08:40,850
A screenplay.

71
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:41,679
A screenplay?

72
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,980
That's so cool!

73
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,720
When will it be made into a movie?

74
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,440
Let me know when it does.

75
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,600
I'll come support you.

76
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,030
Sure.

77
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,000
You know why I got my nose done?

78
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:53,480
Why?

79
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:56,280
I wanted to look better on camera.

80
00:08:56,530 --> 00:08:59,660
Who knows? Maybe a talent scout
will discover me one day.

81
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:01,300
You want to be an actress?

82
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:04,660
Well, if I ever make a movie,

83
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,510
-I'll give you a role.
-Really?

84
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,280
It's a deal, then.

85
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:13,200
Hello, Director.

86
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,650
I'm Ji. I'm an actress.

87
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,970
Nice to meet you, Ji.

88
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,980
I'm Xu Jing. I'm a director.

89
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,250
Hello, Director Xu.

90
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:22,020
How was my acting?

91
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,600
It was fantastic.

92
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,560
You should've seen

93
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:26,000
that jerk's face just now.

94
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,440
He actually thought he was so charming.

95
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,480
What a joke.

96
00:09:30,790 --> 00:09:31,910
Thanks, Ji.

97
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:34,740
No need to thank me.

98
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,600
If you really want
to show your appreciation,

99
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,720
just give me more chances
to act in the future.

100
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,050
Let me get my acting fix!

101
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,670
Sure, no problem.

102
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,000
So,

103
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,790
you...

104
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:08,440
Dr. Fang.

105
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:17,570
I've never been someone
people paid much attention to.

106
00:10:17,870 --> 00:10:18,630
That's why I've always dreamed

107
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:20,480
of becoming an influencer or a celebrity.

108
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,010
Dr. Fang,

109
00:10:21,940 --> 00:10:24,590
this girl came in
asking about cosmetic surgery.

110
00:10:24,590 --> 00:10:26,630
I noticed
that the ID information she provided

111
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:27,120
didn't match her actual identity.

112
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:29,980
[Personal Information]

113
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,630
I asked her a few questions.

114
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,890
She's still underage,

115
00:10:30,070 --> 00:10:31,550
so I turned her down.

116
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,520
I also asked
why she wanted cosmetic surgery.

117
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,510
She said she wanted

118
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:37,000
to become a member
so she could make money.

119
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:37,530
A member?

120
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:39,610
Member of what?

121
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:41,960
Spotlight Bar.
